WEBVTT

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.450
<i>My name is Karasuma Sakura.</i>

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.640
<i>I teach English at a certain high school.</i>

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.100
Karasuma-sensei.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.030
Good morning.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.970
Don't run in the hallway.

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.130
Okay.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.190
<i>I adore all my students.</i>

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.900
<i>Every day is so much fun.</i>

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.260
Good morning, everyone.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.030
Oh?

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.290
You've all got the wrong textbooks.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:40.700
No, actually...

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.330
Your class is next door.

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:45.380
Huh?

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:46.590
What?!

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:47.320
Oh, no!

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.400
Really?

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:51.600
<i>I won't let this get me down!</i>

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.890
I will now return your tests.

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.640
Oomiya-san.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:57.390
Yes.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:04.310
<i>Oomiya-san, I can feel your enthusiasm, but...</i>

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:05.440
<i>No, no...</i>

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.480
<i>She's no good at English,</i>

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.780
<i>but she's doing all she can to pursue her dream.</i>

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.610
<i>That's a wonderful thing.</i>

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:15.570
Try a little harder next time.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:16.530
I will.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.580
I got an A for effort!

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.660
Sensei, please don't go so easy on her.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:28.000
Can you translate this sentence into Japanese, Inokuma-san?

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.630
Right!

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:30.250
I don't know the answer!

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:31.170
No shame at all?!

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.630
But I think Komichi-san knows the answer.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:35.750
What?

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:39.010
Komichi-san is smart, and she works very hard.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:39.720
Hey...

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:47.740
S-Sensei, will you allow me to answer the question?

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:48.540
What?

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.400
Sure.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.190
Go ahead.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.980
C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:55.030
And Shino said she has trouble understanding this part.

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:57.860
Shino's not very good at perfect tense.

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:02.230
Shino can't understand any sentence longer than five words.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:06.920
You really like Oomiya-san, don't you?

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.000
I like her, too.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:13.340
<i>Why's she making that face?!</i>

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:45.600
Do you get it?

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.810
It's easy if you think of it this way.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:50.310
Yes, I understand now.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.600
Good.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:55.440
<i>She's watching us.</i>

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.190
<i>From right in front of me, even.</i>

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.750
Sorry, Karasu-chan.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:08.080
I didn't think you'd be that surprised.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:12.480
Sensei, you dropped something.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.530
Is it a photo of your boyfriend?

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:17.670
N-No, it's a photo of my pet.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:19.910
It's a rabbit.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.720
It's so cute.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.220
What's its name?

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:24.710
What?

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:28.310
Oh, um... It's...

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.420
I-It's a secret.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.190
<i>Why?</i>

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.230
You're acting awfully suspicious, Karasu-chan.

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:37.190
I'm not suspicious at all.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.570
What's its name, Karasu-chan?

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:43.450
Karasuma-sensei's nickname is "Karasu-chan".

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:49.570
It'd be nice if you had a nickname that was easier to say.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:50.830
Like what?

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:54.110
Ka... Karasu...

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:56.060
Oh, Karasumi!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.590
N-Not that!

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:02.340
<i>Did she have a bad experience with the mullet roe dish, karasumi?!</i>

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:07.510
In any case, I want a nickname, too.

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:08.970
You want one now?

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:09.750
Yes.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.730
Something like Ayaya.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.350
You just started calling me that on your own.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.940
My name is Shinobu, so my nickname is Shino.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.900
Something like that would be nice.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:23.780
Ka... Kare... Kare...

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:25.910
How about "Curry"?

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.490
Do you think people will mistake your name for the food?

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:32.670
Like, "Hey, Curry, want some curry?"

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:33.360
You know what?

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.160
Forget it.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.720
Oomiya-san.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:38.290
Yes?

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:42.630
You had something stuck to your skirt.

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.520
Thank you.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.850
<i>She's watching us again.</i>

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:55.380
<i>I should come straight out and ask her.</i>

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:58.860
Alice-san, do you dislike me?!

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:03.440
If there's anything you would like me to change, please tell me!

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:06.950
Karasuma-sensei?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:08.990
All right!

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:12.900
Do I like you?

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.700
Of course I do.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.290
<i>Good.</i>

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:21.750
I wish you wouldn't get overly friendly with Shino, though.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:25.590
You know, I didn't say this earlier,

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:29.050
but my rabbit's name is also Alice.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:33.720
You're just so cute, I ended up giving my rabbit the same... name...

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:34.490
Oh?

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.890
Did that creep you out a little?

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.440
There!

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:47.320
I actually picked up a second photo that fell out at the same time the photo of her rabbit did.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.490
I think it's an old photo of Karasu-chan.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:52.120
How cute.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:55.500
She looks exactly like she does now, though.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.080
No!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.710
That photo... That photo...

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:04.210
...was taken during the cosplay contest at the end-of-year party!

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:06.170
What have you been doing, Sensei?!

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:21.300
Wow, I'm number one!

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:23.240
That's great, Shino.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:28.340
<i>I'm sorry, all of you Aries.</i>

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.610
<i>Your lucky colour is blue.</i>

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.160
We're going now.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.450
What's wrong, Alice?

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:42.040
I'm trying to stay as close as I can to someone lucky.

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:47.460
You don't need to worry so much about horoscopes.

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:59.150
Shino!

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:01.230
A-Are you all right?

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.310
Yes, we're fine.

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:08.030
<i>Is all my bad luck transferring to Shino?</i>

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:09.610
Look.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:12.740
It's a couple of foreign twins.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.870
They're so cute!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:18.160
Something good's already happened.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.660
<i>Shino's so positive.</i>

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.420
That's my Shino!

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:31.340
Okay.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.010
Hello-

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.180
Karasuma-sensei?

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.800
Oops, we got the wrong person?

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.860
<i>I-I won't let this get me down.</i>

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:51.830
<i>As a teacher, I...</i>

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:55.780
Y-You shouldn't pull such shocking pranks!

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.210
We're sorry.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:57.910
What?

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.580
We're sorry.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:01.830
It's our homeroom teacher's birthday,

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.410
and we wanted to surprise him.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.420
You guys...

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:17.160
You have wonderful students, Sensei.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.930
What <i>is</i> this?

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.320
Let's play grasslot baseball!

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.150
Baseball?

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.320
Yes.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.430
Sure, but I don't know the rules.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.200
Youko can handle that.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.580
You don't know either?

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:43.960
I borrowed some equipment from my father.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.960
I have a bat, gloves, and a ball.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.960
It's a little dirty, but I hope you don't mind.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:51.590
Is that an autographed ball?!

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:56.470
I want to be the batter.

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:59.510
Okay, I'll be the coach.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.060
Ayaya will be the manager.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.770
I'm one of those female managers, huh?

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:06.020
Shino will be our cheerleader.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:06.890
Okay!

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:11.880
Alice will be our on-field mascot.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.610
Like those people on the field who dress up in costumes?

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.410
And with that...

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:22.330
Hit it out of the park, Youko!

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:23.610
Hit what?!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:29.540
We can't play a game, so let's practice pitching and batting.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.880
I'm batting?

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.010
What should the manager be doing?

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.370
Cheering.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.850
How is that any different from what Shino's doing?

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.020
Your status is different.

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:45.460
Here we go.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:51.190
There!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:02.330
Go! Go... Y-Youko...

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.240
What?

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:05.660
Here we go.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.670
Keep your eye on the ball.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.590
I don't think I can hit it.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:17.690
Don't worry about it.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.260
Those were some nice swings.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.640
Don't give up yet.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:25.390
But my luck is supposed to be terrible today.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:28.560
Go! Go, Alice!

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:34.070
You can do it, Alice.

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.440
Shino.

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:38.710
You can hit it.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:39.700
Don't worry.

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:42.700
Okay.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:46.950
Play ball!

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.380
Here we go.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:52.920
<i>Instead of the horoscope, I'll believe in Shino!</i>

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:01.300
Shino, I did it.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:04.010
That was amazing, Alice.

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.560
You need to run to first base.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:07.560
F-First base?

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:08.720
Which way is that?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.640
The side you hold your bowl on.

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:13.810
No, I thought it was the side you hold your chopsticks on.

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:16.810
I don't have the heart to tell them it was a foul ball.

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:18.960
Good job, Alice!

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.590
Can we stop by the bookstore on the way home?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:23.900
Sure.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.640
Let's go together.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:31.530
Karen, I didn't know you liked books so much.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:34.920
A new volume of the manga I like came out.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.250
This is it.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:40.760
Japan's culture of manga and anime is amazing.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:44.760
It's helped me a lot with my Japanese.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:48.180
I think you should put your language textbooks into manga format, too.

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:49.680
Good idea.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:51.180
I don't know about that.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.060
It's a foreign girl.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:57.590
You're right.

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:59.440
I wonder what she's reading.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:02.240
M-Maybe this book is too childish.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:06.450
Alice, what are you reading?

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.450
<i>What?</i>

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:11.950
Hey, Isa-nee's in here.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.390
I bet these clothes would look good on you.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.830
You think so?

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:20.520
Oh, I bet you'd look good in these frilly ones.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.970
R-Really?

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.680
I'm going to go look over there.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.430
This month's horoscope is...

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.560
Are you looking at the horoscopes?

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.430
What's it say for Gemini?

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:42.030
Your horoscope doesn't look very good this month.

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:42.860
What?

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:44.360
It doesn't?

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.740
Horoscopes don't mean anything.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.870
After all, you're really positive, Shino.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.460
Thank you.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.460
I'm happy because I have you around.

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:58.320
You're like my good luck charm.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:00.460
<i>I'm not sure I like that.</i>

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:11.910
Orange?

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.600
Do I have any orange clothes?

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.980
Now, picking up where we left off last time...

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:20.230
Um, Sensei?

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:23.480
What is that tangerine for?

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.740
It's an orange!

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.490
Aya, you're type A, right?

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:32.450
Yes.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.700
Youko, you're type O, aren't you?

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:35.540
That's right.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:40.580
They say type As and Os get along well.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:48.050
I-I see.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.590
I'm also type A.

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:51.440
So am I.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.320
Really?

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:53.560
I see.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:02.190
<i>Shino gets up late on weekends.</i>

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.360
Shino.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:06.030
Wake up.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:10.660
Elizabeth.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:12.990
Who?

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:21.040
You two look exactly the same when you first wake up.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.340
What does that mean?

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:26.390
Oh, my glasses.

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:29.220
Alice, have you seen my glasses?

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:32.170
Isami, you don't wear glasses!

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:33.890
Go wash your face!

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:40.810
Elizabeth is the name of a doll I saw in a store.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:43.270
It was an expensive antique.

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.010
I see.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.610
Shinobu...

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:51.450
If Alice were on sale in a store, how much would you pay for her?

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.140
What do you mean?!

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.040
That's a difficult question.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.750
Don't take it that seriously!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.760
A hundred thousand yen?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:04.500
That's cheap!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.760
A h-hundred thousand yen is cheap?

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:11.820
I-It's not cheap, but I'm worth more than a doll!

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.970
Geez, Isami!

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.640
You're right.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:18.770
You can't buy friends with money.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:22.180
That's right, Isami.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:26.730
Onee-chan, you're actually a con artist, aren't you?

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.040
I'm a model.

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:33.370
Where should I go today?

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.910
Where? Where? Where? Where?

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:38.450
It's a cat.

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:40.410
Meow, meow.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:41.910
Meow.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:00.980
Gotcha!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:05.330
Where am I?

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:12.030
Hello, Oomiya residence.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.840
Oh, Shino.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.390
Yes, this is Shino.

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:16.740
What's wrong?

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.400
I found a cat.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:19.980
It's a white cat.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.870
A white cat?

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:23.660
Yes.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.380
Its long tail and whiskers are so cute.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.480
Oh, it ran off.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.610
Play nicely with it, okay?

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.510
I will.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.300
See you.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:38.020
Karen found a white cat.

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:38.750
What?

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:39.680
That's all she wanted to say?

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:43.270
I forgot to ask her the most important question.

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.940
Well, whatever.

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:50.900
I finished my homework and my review.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.490
I'm so bored.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.910
W-Why am I getting nervous?

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.610
This is Inokuma.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.730
Y-Youko?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.550
It's me, A-Ayayayaya.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.970
I was thinking of going to the station!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.300
I'm not inviting you or anything,

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:21.140
but if you're free, would you care to come?

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:24.020
Um, this is her brother.

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.750
I'll hand the phone to...

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:29.230
Huh?

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.110
She hung up.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:32.850
What's up?

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:35.350
Onee-chan, let's keep playing.

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:37.070
Play by yourselves.

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:39.760
You two are too strong for me to have any fun.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.280
What?

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:47.710
We're strong because the person who made this game is our real father.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:48.830
What?!

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:51.380
He looks just like this moustached man.

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:55.970
We're not blood relatives?

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:57.130
We were kidding.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:04.390
Alice.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:07.450
Would you like to go shopping together?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.520
Yes.

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.240
I'm going to get changed.

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:12.400
Give me a minute.

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:15.980
You could have gone in the clothes you were wearing.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:20.020
Thank you for waiting.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.250
Come on, stop being mad already.

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:31.420
I-I'm not mad.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:36.330
I'm the one who called your house, anyway...

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.420
I'll treat you to some cake.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:40.180
<i>Cake...</i>

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:41.550
<i>She's so easy to read.</i>

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:45.930
I wish I had a cute little sister like you.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.430
S-Sister?

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:50.090
What?

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:52.320
Did I say something wrong?!

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:54.190
Oh, it's Youko and Aya.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:55.840
Youko!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.110
Aya!

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.280
Are you out shopping?

00:19:58.280 --> 00:19:59.320
Yes.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.460
What a coincidence.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:03.220
Are you two shopping, too?

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.100
Shino!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:06.200
Alice!

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:15.540
If I had known you were all free, I would have invited you.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.910
We were just hanging out.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:20.380
Would you like to go somewhere together next weekend?

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.680
Good idea.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.350
We're about to go eat some cake.

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:25.180
Cake?

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:28.810
Uh, Karen, you should take a bath first.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.860
How did you get so dirty?

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:35.620
We have some shopping to do.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:38.280
Let's hang out together next time, okay?

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.130
Yes.

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:44.410
See you tomorrow.

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:45.960
See you at school.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:49.290
Seeing everyone on a weekend feels kinda weird.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.370
It does.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.830
Oh, that's right.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:53.750
What is it?

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:58.130
Don't forget to study for tomorrow's quiz.

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:00.130
Don't remind us of unpleasant stuff!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.820
What kind of quiz is it?

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.240
It's an English quiz, Shino.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.970
Oh, I forgot.

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.630
You're going to make Karasu-chan cry.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:10.950
Totem pole, to-

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.230
Oh?

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:17.120
Here, kitty.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:18.900
Here, kitty, kitty.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.900
Here, kitty, kitty, kitty.

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:57.100
Flap your wings and fly, Paul.

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:02.120
Karasuma-sensei, is something wrong?

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:05.760
No, I've just been thinking lately.

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:11.890
They'll all graduate someday and leave this school.

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:15.480
I hope they'll all grow up to be fine young ladies.

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:20.900
Sensei, your students are first years, aren't they?

00:23:21.320 --> 00:23:22.160
It's Kouta and...

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:22.910
...Mitsuki's...

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:24.370
...episode preview.

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:27.110
The next episode is the long-awaited English battle arc.

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:31.450
Shinobu-oneechan gets turned into a doll in the beginning and doesn't appear after that.

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:32.460
What?!

00:23:32.460 --> 00:23:33.450
They're kidding!

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:34.000
Well...

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:35.110
I don't know about that.

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:35.820
Hey!
